#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#The purpose of this example is to demonstrate how a VS solver program can be loaded and run from an external program made with Visual Basic, as described in a tech memo accessed from Help -> Technical Memos -> Example: Automating Runs with the VS API.
#
#If you want to use the feature which allows you to save multiple sets of results, the ring control must be set prior generating the files for the run.
#
#To make the run:
#1. Click the button "Generate Files for this Run",
#2. Run run the program "VS_Run.exe" (located in the folder Extensions\Custom_VB).
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

